    "rationale": "Kew POWO accepts Anthemis cotula as a distinct species. Taiwan's Agricultural Chemicals Research Institute explicitly pairs Anthemis cotula with 臭甘菊, and the National Museum of Natural Science collection pairs it with 臭春黃菊. These independent authorities override a demonstrably conflicting TaiCOL synonym link to Eclipta prostrata/鱧腸."
  },
