      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "         Syn. Anthemis cotuloides Rafinesque.    A. foetida Lamarck. A. psorosperma Tenore.\nA. ramosa Link. Chamaemelum Cotula Allioni.       Cotula ‚foetida J. Bauhin. Maruta (otula DC.\nM. foetida Cassini. M. vulgaris Bluff & Fingerhut.",
